!EXPANSIONS & CONTRACTIONS
!Author: Dirk Vandycke, TASC March 2014
!Coded by: Richard Denning 6/11/2014
!www.TradersEdgeSystems.com

C is [close].
C1 is valresult(C,1).
H is [high].
L is [low].
O is [open].
TH is max(C1,H).
TL is min(C1,L).
TR is TH - TL.
ATR is simpleavg(TR,20).
RCL is (C-TL) / TR.
EU is (C-O) / TR.
